          "reason": "Android 智能选区使用 Foundation 的 LocalLocaleList.current；传 null 会在长按分类时崩溃。所选上游改用当前语言列表后移除"
        },
        "upstream-patches/tiqian-core-performance.patch": {
          "base": "8929bfc925c9bc3634f9a2ea3442dd32d9088318",
          "sha256": "c7bdb84aa052c094024a7cd95876c81b204f924aae230640c55217fcf0dcf220",
          "reason": "https://github.com/tiqian-cjk/tiqian/pull/61 减少重复字形扫描，在文档与字体来源内复用精确段落布局并保留正确重绘；所选上游包含实现且相关回归通过后移除"
        },
        "upstream-patches/tiqian-windows-fonts.patch": {
          "base": "8929bfc925c9bc3634f9a2ea3442dd32d9088318",
          "sha256": "c400d541c70305ccc3b6f5a265f3c60c4a5f3441d3027cd3b8528e0bfb70ee77",
          "reason": "https://github.com/tiqian-cjk/tiqian/pull/37 的 Skia Windows 字体候选，与既有 YaHei UI 后备合并；当上游候选覆盖同一字体集时移除"
        },
        "upstream-patches/tiqian-core-build-configuration.patch": {
          "base": "8929bfc925c9bc3634f9a2ea3442dd32d9088318",
          "sha256": "e42fa9c5b488fa5a6fc7e6c2bd3af727d74c3c63e22a54dc3d86a9244deae447",
          "reason": "组合构建禁止回落到未替换的 Tiqian Maven；保留官方完整模块与断言。固定上游 LegacyFontConfigParserTest 的文件名比较统一 Windows 路径分隔符，字体链与顺序断言不变；所选上游含等价修正后移除该测试补丁"
        },
        "upstream-patches/tiqian-core-apple-italic-ink.patch": {
          "base": "8929bfc925c9bc3634f9a2ea3442dd32d9088318",
          "sha256": "7218a5b895b01cf6e637d2b1f391eb56a16e55d3e64741f954bd35d5f7030bfc",
          "reason": "CoreText 斜体验证按固定基线逐行比较字形剪切；全字最右墨列不能表示笔画倾角。上游覆盖相同字形契约后移除"
        },
        "upstream-patches/tiqian-core-skiko-alignment.patch": {
          "base": "8929bfc925c9bc3634f9a2ea3442dd32d9088318",
          "sha256": "dee031e763c2337f37060e9c2ec188eff2bc8292a79382efb9255ac98970a15e",
          "reason": "宿主的 Compose Multiplatform 运行在 Skiko 0.156.1，其 FontStyle 改为 value class、三参构造改收 FontWeight/FontWidth，按 0.144.6 编译的桌面类会 NoSuchMethodError；JVM 类路径按宿主 Skiko 解析，FontStyle 构造改用两代 Skiko 通用的 withWeight/withSlant。跑上游自带桌面测试加 -PtiqianUpstreamSkiko=true；宿主 Skiko 变更时同步补丁内版本号，所选上游自身使用同代 Skiko 后移除"
        }
      },
